# 📊 Format Specifiers

| Specifier | Meaning   |
| --------- | --------- |
| %d        | Integer   |
| %f        | Float     |
| %s        | String    |
| %t        | Boolean   |
| %c        | Character |

---

## Example

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func main() {
    name := "Anup"
    age := 21
    percentage := 89.5

    fmt.Printf("Name: %s\n", name)
    fmt.Printf("Age: %d\n", age)
    fmt.Printf("Percentage: %.2f\n", percentage)
}
```

